{"slug":"visitor-at-midnight","madeOn":"2026-10-21","script":{"id":"showcase-visitor-at-midnight","title":"The French Lady","format":"audiobook","ambience":"city","cast":[{"name":"Narrator","voice":"george","effect":"none","volume":85},{"name":"Holmes","voice":"jean","effect":"none","volume":85},{"name":"Watson","voice":"reid","effect":"none","volume":85},{"name":"Mrs. Hudson","voice":"eve","effect":"none","volume":85}],"firstSceneId":"main","scenes":[{"id":"main","title":"The French Lady","cues":[{"kind":"speech","speaker":"Narrator","text":"The fog lay thick over Baker Street, and the gas lamps burned like dull coins in the gloom.","startsParagraph":true},{"kind":"speech","speaker":"Narrator","text":"Holmes looked up from his violin.","startsParagraph":false},{"kind":"speech","speaker":"Holmes","text":"Watson, we have a visitor. A lady, by the sound of her step, and in some haste.","startsParagraph":false},{"kind":"speech","speaker":"Narrator","text":"Watson set down his paper.","startsParagraph":false},{"kind":"speech","speaker":"Watson","text":"At this hour, Holmes? It is nearly midnight.","startsParagraph":false},{"kind":"sound","sound":"door_knock","description":"A knock at the door","startsParagraph":true},{"kind":"speech","speaker":"Narrator","text":"A sharp knock echoed through the hall, and Mrs. Hudson appeared at the door, quite out of breath.","startsParagraph":false},{"kind":"speech","speaker":"Mrs. Hudson","text":"There's a French lady downstairs, Mr. Holmes. She says it cannot wait until morning.","startsParagraph":false},{"kind":"speech","speaker":"Holmes","text":"Then it shan't. Show her up, Mrs. Hudson.","startsParagraph":false}],"choices":[]}],"showcase":"visitor-at-midnight"},"lines":{"main/4":{"audio":"lines/main-4.mp3","wordStarts":[0.198,0.346,0.594,0.841,1.6,1.683,1.831,2.112]},"main/0":{"audio":"lines/main-0.mp3","wordStarts":[0.665,0.747,1.088,1.25,1.575,1.819,2.079,2.712,2.793,2.874,3.199,3.589,3.849,4.076,4.32,4.677,4.807,4.905]},"main/1"